<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Sunkyong Ltd H1 net down.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Sunkyong Ltd H1 net down.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				   197  vs 253</p>
<p>    Net					  5.04  vs 5.15</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			7.04  vs 6.17</p>
<p>    Revenue				2,980.96  vs 2,103.36</p>
<p>NOTE - Sunkyong Ltd is a trading arm of the Sunkyong Group. The Korea Listed Companies Association provided the figures and gave no further details.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
</text>
